  "architecture_summary": "A full-stack FastAPI + React application using a monorepo structure with Bun workspaces. Backend provides REST API with JWT authentication via Python-Jose, stores data in PostgreSQL using SQLAlchemy ORM with Alembic migrations. Frontend uses React 18 with TanStack Router for navigation, TanStack Query for data fetching, and openapi-fetch for type-safe API calls. Docker Compose orchestrates frontend, backend, PostgreSQL, Traefik reverse proxy, and Mailcatcher for development. shadcn/ui components used for UI library with dark mode support.",
  "key_patterns": [
    "JWT Bearer token authentication via FastAPI dependencies",
    "SQLAlchemy ORM with Alembic migrations for database schema",
    "OpenAPI client code generation for type-safe API communication",
    "TanStack Router file-based routing with layout system",
    "shadcn/ui component composition pattern",
    "React Query for server state management",
    "Password hashing with Passlib bcrypt",
    "Role-based access control via dependency injection",
    "Docker multi-service orchestration with Traefik",
    "End-to-end testing with Playwright",
    "Dark/light theme persistence via React Context"
  ]
}